CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 49 forward through auto-return member: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
An auto-returning member function template forwards its parameter to
an rvalue-reference callee (N5008 [dcl.spec.auto], [forward]/4,
[dcl.init.ref]/5.3 -- the libc++ take-closure shape).  The eager
auto-return conversion must not leave the body queued for a second
conversion: the re-typecheck refused to re-bind the materialised
xvalue and silently dropped the body.
